      "id": "sol.hmmt-nov-guts-2024-p10.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Observe\n\n\\[\\left(3^{4}+1\\right)^{3}=3^{12}+3 \\cdot 3^{8}+3 \\cdot 3^{4}+1=3^{12}+3^{9}+3^{5}+1\\]\n\nso the answer is the largest prime factor of \\(3^{4}+1=82\\), which is 41 .",
